# A camp skirmish (synthetic, invented): the Tarnished locks on a sentry that closes in, trades blows with it, lands a
# critical hit and kills it in sight of two others; one charges and is left behind beyond 30 m; the third follows and
# stands near until its engagement times out. Our own route, names and numbers.
route camp-skirmish
seed 11
step 250
end 40000

at 0     spawn player hp=1000/1000 pos=0,0,0
at 0     place 61001
at 0     spawn ash team=6 pos=24,0,0 hp=500/500
at 0     spawn briar team=6 pos=27,3,0 hp=500/500
at 0     spawn cinder team=6 pos=26,-4,0 hp=300/300
at 6000  lock ash
at 6000  move ash to=10,0,0 over=2000
at 8500  move player to=6,0,0 over=1000
at 9000  hit player -> ash dmg=60
at 9500  hit ash -> player dmg=90
at 9750  hit player -> ash dmg=60
at 10000 hit player -> ash dmg=200
at 10500 hit player -> ash dmg=80
at 10750 throw player 3
at 10750 throw ash 4
at 11250 throw player 0
at 11250 throw ash 0
at 11250 unlock
at 11250 kill ash by=player
at 12000 move briar to=9,2,0 over=1500
at 14000 hit briar -> player dmg=120
at 15000 move player to=50,0,0 over=1500
at 17000 place 61002
at 18000 move cinder to=46,0,0 over=2000
at 21000 heal player amount=300
at 33000 ride on
at 36000 ride off

# What the route must show (ARCH §8.4, §8.7): the lock, then the lock while closing, raising the engagement across 0.6.
expect event Engaged subject=ash via=LockOnly conf=0.3 within 6000..6000
expect event Engaged subject=ash via=LockClosing conf=0.6 within 6250..8000
expect count 2 Engaged subject=ash
# Hits merge per pair over 2.5 s; the third's 64% within 3 s turns hard, a salient change, re-emitted as merged.
expect event Struck subject=ash att=player hard=false count=1 within 9000..9000
expect event Struck subject=ash att=player hard=true merged=true count=3 within 10000..10000
expect count 2 Struck subject=ash
expect event Struck subject=player att=ash within 9500..9500
expect event LowHp subject=ash within 10500..10500
expect event CritLanded subject=ash within 10750..10750
expect event AllyDied victim=ash witnesses=[cinder,briar] within 11250..11250
expect no Disengaged subject=ash
expect event Engaged subject=briar via=Near
expect event Disengaged subject=briar why=Distance fled=true within 15000..17000
expect event Engaged subject=cinder via=Near squad=2
expect event Healed subject=player within 21000..21000
expect event Disengaged subject=cinder why=Timeout fled=false within 27000..28000
expect event PlaceEntered place_id=61002 prev=61001 within 19000..19000
expect count 2 MountChanged
